   "source": [
    "# Multi-Platform Content Repurposer with n8n\n",
    "\n",
    "**Framework**: n8n (Low-Code Automation) + Python | **Models**: OpenAI GPT-4, Anthropic Claude\n",
    "\n",
    "An intelligent content repurposing system that automatically transforms content across multiple social media platforms with platform-specific optimization. Uses n8n workflows for automation and AI models for content adaptation.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Features\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Multi-Platform Support**: Twitter, LinkedIn, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook\n",
    "- **Content Intelligence**: AI-powered content analysis and optimization\n",
    "- **Platform Optimization**: Automatic format, tone, and style adaptation\n",
    "- **Scheduling Integration**: Automated posting across platforms\n",
    "- **Performance Tracking**: Analytics and engagement monitoring\n",
    "- **Brand Consistency**: Maintains brand voice while adapting to platform norms\n",
    "\n",
    "## Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "The system combines n8n's visual workflow automation with AI-powered content processing:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Content Ingestion**: Webhook triggers from various sources\n",
    "2. **Content Analysis**: AI-powered content understanding and categorization\n",
    "3. **Platform Adaptation**: Custom AI prompts for each platform\n",
    "4. **Media Processing**: Image/video optimization for different platforms\n",
    "5. **Scheduling & Publishing**: Automated posting with optimal timing\n",
    "6. **Performance Monitoring**: Real-time analytics and feedback loops\n",
    "\n",
    "## Installation\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "# Install n8n\n",
    "npm install -g n8n\n",
    "\n",
    "# Install Python dependencies\n",
    "pip install openai anthropic requests pillow moviepy tweepy python-linkedin facebook-sdk instagrapi\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "## Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "Configure your API keys and n8n environment:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import json\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "from datetime import datetime, timedelta\n",
    "from typing import Dict, List, Any, Optional, Tuple\n",
    "from dataclasses import dataclass\n",
    "from enum import Enum\n",
    "import base64\n",
    "import hashlib\n",
    "from PIL import Image\n",
    "import io\n",
    "import re\n",
    "\n",
    "# Platform-specific imports\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    import tweepy\n",
    "    from linkedin_api import Linkedin\n",
    "    from instagrapi import Client\n",
    "    SOCIAL_APIS_AVAILABLE = True\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    SOCIAL_APIS_AVAILABLE = False\n",
    "    print(\"⚠️  Social media APIs not available - using mock responses\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# AI Model clients\n",
    "from openai import OpenAI\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    import anthropic\n",
    "    ANTHROPIC_AVAILABLE = True\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    ANTHROPIC_AVAILABLE = False\n",
    "\n",
    "# Initialize AI clients\n",
    "openai_client = OpenAI(api_key=os.getenv(\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"))\n",
    "if ANTHROPIC_AVAILABLE:\n",
    "    anthropic_client = anthropic.Anthropic(api_key=os.getenv(\"ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\"))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ Multi-Platform Content Repurposer initialized!\")\n",
    "print(f\"📱 Social APIs available: {SOCIAL_APIS_AVAILABLE}\")\n",
    "print(f\"🤖 Anthropic available: {ANTHROPIC_AVAILABLE}\")"
   ]
